{"seq":1,"slug":"why-streaming","title":"为何世界流送","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-streaming-open-world/foundations/why-streaming","wordCount":1685,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"为何世界流送\">为何世界流送</h1><p>一张现代开放世界地图的「真实体积」可以拿数字直接吓人：一个 8km × 8km 的地块，铺上 4K 虚拟纹理、Nanite 网格、植被实例和音频资源，磁盘占用轻松到几十上百 GB。而主机的统一内存是固定的——PS5 是 16GB GDDR6，其中还要分给操作系统、显存、音频和引擎自身，留给游戏世界资源的往往只有 10GB 上下。把整张图塞进内存，从第一帧起就是不可能任务。世界流送存在的全部理由，是把这个「不可能」拆成「玩家此刻可见的一小块，永远塞得进内存」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>世界流送的本质是一个<strong>滑动窗口</strong>：世界是固定的大数据集，内存里只保留以玩家为中心的一个窗口，玩家移动时窗口跟着滑，新进入窗口的内容被加载，滑出窗口的内容被卸载。整个系统的目标是让内存占用恒定、而内容随玩家滚动。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[完整世界&lt;br/&gt;磁盘上 数百 GB] --&gt; B[空间分区&lt;br/&gt;切成可装卸 cell]&#10;    B --&gt; C[流送窗口&lt;br/&gt;以玩家为中心]&#10;    C --&gt; D[加载&lt;br/&gt;进入窗口的 cell]&#10;    C --&gt; E[卸载&lt;br/&gt;滑出窗口的 cell]&#10;    D --&gt; F[内存占用恒定&lt;br/&gt;约 10 GB 预算]&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[玩家感知&lt;br/&gt;无边界的连续世界]\">flowchart TD\n    A[完整世界&lt;br/&gt;磁盘上 数百 GB] --&gt; B[空间分区&lt;br/&gt;切成可装卸 cell]\n    B --&gt; C[流送窗口&lt;br/&gt;以玩家为中心]\n    C --&gt; D[加载&lt;br/&gt;进入窗口的 cell]\n    C --&gt; E[卸载&lt;br/&gt;滑出窗口的 cell]\n    D --&gt; F[内存占用恒定&lt;br/&gt;约 10 GB 预算]\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[玩家感知&lt;br/&gt;无边界的连续世界]</pre><p>三个约束共同逼出流送，缺一不可：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束维度</th>\n<th>物理上限（典型值，2026）</th>\n<th>不流送的后果</th>\n<th>流送如何化解</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内存容量</td>\n<td>PS5 16GB 统一内存，游戏可用约 10GB</td>\n<td>大图直接 OOM，进不去游戏</td>\n<td>只常驻玩家窗口内的 cell</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IO 带宽</td>\n<td>PS5 解压后峰值约 22 GB/s</td>\n<td>一次性读盘卡死数秒</td>\n<td>按需小批量、后台异步读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>处理预算</td>\n<td>单帧 16.6ms（60fps）</td>\n<td>单帧反序列化巨量对象掉帧</td>\n<td>时间切片，摊到多帧</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"内存墙-为什么-10gb-装不下-8km-世界\">内存墙：为什么 10GB 装不下 8km 世界</h2><p>把「世界有多大」翻译成「内存要多少」，最直观的是算资源密度。假设一个开放世界平均每平方公里铺设的可加载资源（网格、纹理、碰撞、音频、逻辑）解压后占内存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span>，世界面积 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>，则全装内存的需求是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{full} = \\rho \\cdot A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>取一个保守的中等密度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>200</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>MB/km</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho \\approx 200\\,\\text{MB/km}^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6776em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MB/km</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（含纹理 mip、碰撞与逻辑），世界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>km</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = 64\\,\\text{km}^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（8km×8km），则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>MB/km</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>64</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>km</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>12.8</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>GB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{full} = 200\\,\\text{MB/km}^2 \\times 64\\,\\text{km}^2 = 12.8\\,\\text{GB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MB/km</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12.8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GB</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>已经超过 10GB 的预算上限——而这还是「中等密度」。AAA 城市级密度的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>GB/km</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\sim2\\,\\text{GB/km}^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GB/km</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，全装内存的需求会冲到几十 GB，比可用内存高一个数量级。流送把需求改写为只覆盖窗口面积 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{win} = \\pi r^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 为加载半径）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{stream} = \\rho \\cdot \\pi r^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">am</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = 500\\,\\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>0.25</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>157</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>MB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{stream} = 200 \\times \\pi \\times 0.25 \\approx 157\\,\\text{MB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">am</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.25</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">157</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MB</span></span></span></span></span></span>——和世界总面积<strong>完全无关</strong>，只和加载半径有关。这就是流送最关键的性质：内存占用与世界大小解耦，世界可以无限大，内存预算却恒定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"带宽墙-ssd-很快-但还是有上限\">带宽墙：SSD 很快，但还是有上限</h2><p>有人会说「现在 SSD 这么快，为什么不直接读」。问题不在峰值带宽，而在「一帧只有 16.6ms」。即便 PS5 的硬件解压把有效带宽推到峰值约 22 GB/s（远超最快的 Gen5 PC NVMe），换算到单帧也只有约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>22</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>GB/s</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>0.0166</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>s</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>365</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>MB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">22\\,\\text{GB/s} \\times 0.0166\\,\\text{s} \\approx 365\\,\\text{MB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">22</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GB/s</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0166</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">365</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MB</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的预算，而且这点预算不能全占——还要留给纹理流送、音频流送和系统。</p>\n<p>更现实的瓶颈在 PC：DirectStorage 1.4 引入 Zstandard 编解码改善了 PC 的资源流送，但 GPU 解压一旦和渲染抢同一个计算管线就会反噬性能。Spider-Man 2 的 PC 版（2025 年初发布）就出现过 GPU 解压挤占渲染、在部分 NVIDIA 显卡上关掉 DirectStorage 反而帧稳定性提升 18%~25% 的尴尬。这说明带宽从来不是「白嫖」的，它要和渲染、计算共享同一套硬件，必须当成预算来分配。详细的 IO 流水线与预算分配见 <a href=\"../streaming/async-loading\">异步加载与 IO 预算</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"流送预算三角-本-hub-的统一框架\">流送预算三角：本 hub 的统一框架</h2><p>把三堵墙画在一起，就得到贯穿全 hub 的<strong>流送预算三角</strong>：内存、带宽、处理时间三者互相挤兑，调一个就动另外两个。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[流送预算三角] --&gt; B[内存预算&lt;br/&gt;常驻多少 cell]&#10;    A --&gt; C[带宽预算&lt;br/&gt;每秒读多少 MB]&#10;    A --&gt; D[时间预算&lt;br/&gt;每帧花多少 ms]&#10;    B --&gt;|加载半径变大| C&#10;    C --&gt;|读得越急| D&#10;    D --&gt;|切片越细| E[卡顿风险下降&lt;br/&gt;但延迟上升]&#10;    B --&gt; F[卸载策略&lt;br/&gt;见 unloading-memory]&#10;    C --&gt; G[异步与 DirectStorage&lt;br/&gt;见 async-loading]&#10;    D --&gt; H[时间切片&lt;br/&gt;见 distance-based-streaming]\">flowchart TD\n    A[流送预算三角] --&gt; B[内存预算&lt;br/&gt;常驻多少 cell]\n    A --&gt; C[带宽预算&lt;br/&gt;每秒读多少 MB]\n    A --&gt; D[时间预算&lt;br/&gt;每帧花多少 ms]\n    B --&gt;|加载半径变大| C\n    C --&gt;|读得越急| D\n    D --&gt;|切片越细| E[卡顿风险下降&lt;br/&gt;但延迟上升]\n    B --&gt; F[卸载策略&lt;br/&gt;见 unloading-memory]\n    C --&gt; G[异步与 DirectStorage&lt;br/&gt;见 async-loading]\n    D --&gt; H[时间切片&lt;br/&gt;见 distance-based-streaming]</pre><p>三个顶点对应本 hub 的三篇核心机制文档。加载半径调大，内存占用上升、单位时间要读的数据也上升；为了不爆带宽就得读得更慢，于是 cell 来不及加载，玩家走到边界看到空洞；为了既不爆带宽又不卡顿，就把加载摊到更多帧（时间切片），但摊得越细，从「请求」到「可用」的延迟越长，越容易出现 pop-in。整个流送系统的设计，本质就是在这个三角里找平衡点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"流送-vs-关卡加载-连续世界的本质区别\">流送 vs 关卡加载：连续世界的本质区别</h2><p>传统关卡制游戏（一个 loading 界面切到下一关）也在「装卸」，但那是<strong>离散切换</strong>：玩家被一道明确的边界拦住，旧关卡全卸、新关卡全装，期间用 loading 画面遮住。开放世界流送的难点恰恰是<strong>不能有这道边界</strong>——玩家可以朝任意方向连续移动，装卸必须在玩家无感知的情况下、在他脚下持续发生。</p>\n<p>这带来两个传统关卡加载没有的硬约束：其一，装卸是渐进、并发、可被打断的，玩家随时可能掉头，刚要卸的块又得留下；其二，相邻块之间必须无缝拼接，不能有可见接缝。前者由 <a href=\"../streaming/distance-based-streaming\">按距离流送</a> 的滞后与冷却处理，后者由 <a href=\"../continuity/seamless-transitions\">无缝接缝</a> 处理。理解了「连续」这个词的分量，才理解为什么开放世界流送比关卡加载难一个数量级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>流送的根本动机是三堵墙：内存装不下整图、带宽不能一次性读完、单帧时间不够反序列化海量对象。</li>\n<li>流送把内存需求从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho \\cdot A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>（正比于世界面积）改写为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho \\cdot \\pi r^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（只取决于加载半径），世界大小与内存占用彻底解耦。</li>\n<li>带宽不是免费的：即便 PS5 约 22 GB/s 的峰值，单帧也只有数百 MB，且要和渲染、解压共享硬件。</li>\n<li>流送预算三角（内存/带宽/时间）是本 hub 的统一框架，三个顶点分别对应距离触发、异步加载、卸载三篇核心文档。</li>\n<li>开放世界流送的本质难点在「连续」：装卸必须渐进、并发、可打断、且无缝，这是它远难于传统关卡加载的原因。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>切块的具体做法：<a href=\"world-partitioning\">世界分区</a></li>\n<li>IO 流水线与带宽预算：<a href=\"../streaming/async-loading\">异步加载与 IO 预算</a></li>\n<li>内存记账与卸载：<a href=\"../streaming/unloading-memory\">卸载与内存预算</a></li>\n<li>跨库——通用帧预算与性能基线：<a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/foundations/frame-budget\">性能优化 · 帧预算</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"为何世界流送","id":"为何世界流送"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"内存墙：为什么 10GB 装不下 8km 世界","id":"内存墙-为什么-10gb-装不下-8km-世界"},{"level":2,"text":"带宽墙：SSD 很快，但还是有上限","id":"带宽墙-ssd-很快-但还是有上限"},{"level":2,"text":"流送预算三角：本 hub 的统一框架","id":"流送预算三角-本-hub-的统一框架"},{"level":2,"text":"流送 vs 关卡加载：连续世界的本质区别","id":"流送-vs-关卡加载-连续世界的本质区别"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"世界分区","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-streaming-open-world/foundations/world-partitioning"}}